{"articleNo":"2044","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=2044&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"전산장비 유지보수에 따른 서비스 중단 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.09.29","hit":"8332","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">전산장비 시스템에 대한 유지보수(Patch, 보안업데이트 등)를&nbsp;위해&nbsp; 아래와 같이 전산서비스를 중단하오니 업무에 참조하시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">1. 일시 : <font color=\"#0060ff\">10월8일(토) 13:00&nbsp; ~&nbsp; 10월9일(일) 18:00 까지<br></font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2. 작업내용<br></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1) DB(Oracle) Bug 처리</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) System Patch 처리</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3) 웹메일 용량 증설<br></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">3. 중단서비스<br></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; <font size=\"2\">1) One Stop 서비스</font></span><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<font size=\"2\">&nbsp;2) 통합교육시스템</font></span></font><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; <font size=\"2\">3) 취업정보시스템</font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 4) 인터넷디스크</font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;<font size=\"2\">5) 웹메일서비스<br></font></span></font><font size=\"3\"><br>4. 유지보수 기간중 <font color=\"#0049c4\">인터넷 사용은 가능합니다</font>. 혹 외부접속이 원활하지 못하면 개인&nbsp; 용컴퓨터(PC)에 설정</font><font size=\"3\"> DNS 서버를 아래와 같이 변경하여 사용하시기 바랍니다<!--StartFragment-->\n</font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"></p><font size=\"3\">\n<table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"26\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"165\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">DNS 서버 </span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"26\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"118\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">현재 설정값<br>(~을)</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"26\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"139\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">변경 설정값<br>(~으로)</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-B